 rain settles in the stone.</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="Part" referent="RBX7187"><Properties><string name="Name">ParkLostDrawing</string><CoordinateFrame name="CFrame"><X>-85</X><Y>3.5</Y><Z>97</Z><R00>1</R00><R01>0</R01><R02>0</R02><R10>0</R10><R11>1</R11><R12>0</R12><R20>0</R20><R21>0</R21><R22>1</R22></CoordinateFrame><Vector3 name="size"><X>1.2</X><Y>0.1</Y><Z>0.9</Z></Vector3><bool name="Anchored">true</bool><bool name="CanCollide">false</bool><bool name="CanTouch">false</bool><bool name="CanQuery">true</bool><float name="Transparency">0</float><token name="Material">512</token><Color3uint8 name="Color3uint8">13483670</Color3uint8><token name="TopSurface">0</token><token name="BottomSurface">0</token></Properties><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7181"><Properties><string name="Name">MaterialName</string><string name="Value">Wood</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7182"><Properties><string name="Name">Role</string><string name="Value">record</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7183"><Properties><string name="Name">Title</string><string name="Value">The picnic drawing</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7184"><Properties><string name="Name">Action</string><string name="Value">Inspect the drawing</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7185"><Properties><string name="Name">Index</string><string name="Value">park_drawing</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7186"><Properties><string name="Name">Text</string><string name="Value">Two adults and three children sit beneath this shelter. Someone has pencilled YOU above a different child in each copy. A red bicycle leans against a tree.</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="Part" referent="RBX7513"><Properties><string name="Name">SchoolRegister</string><CoordinateFrame name="CFrame"><X>102</X><Y>3.5</Y><Z>47</Z><R00>1</R00><R01>0</R01><R02>0</R02><R10>0</R10><R11>1</R11><R12>0</R12><R20>0</R20><R21>0</R21><R22>1</R22></CoordinateFrame><Vector3 name="size"><X>1.3</X><Y>0.1</Y><Z>1</Z></Vector3><bool name="Anchored">true</bool><bool name="CanCollide">false</bool><bool name="CanTouch">false</bool><bool name="CanQuery">true</bool><float name="Transparency">0</float><token name="Material">512</token><Color3uint8 name="Color3uint8">13483670</Color3uint8><token name="TopSurface">0</token><token name="BottomSurface">0</token></Properties><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7507"><Properties><string name="Name">MaterialName</string><string name="Value">Wood</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7508"><Properties><string name="Name">Role</string><string name="Value">record</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7509"><Properties><string name="Name">Title</string><string name="Value">The attendance register</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7510"><Properties><string name="Name">Action</string><string name="Value">Read the register</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7511"><Properties><string name="Name">Index</string><string name="Value">school_register</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7512"><Properties><string name="Name">Text</string><string name="Value">Three children at the same address. One entry has been marked transferred; the destination column is blank. Mum's signature appears beside all three. The youngest child's height is recorded in your handwriting.</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="Part" referent="RBX7558"><Properties><string name="Name">SchoolLibraryLetter</string><CoordinateFrame name="CFrame"><X>69</X><Y>3.5</Y><Z>79</Z><R00>1</R00><R01>0</R01><R02>0</R02><R10>0</R10><R11>1</R11><R12>0</R12><R20>0</R20><R21>0</R21><R22>1</R22></CoordinateFrame><Vector3 name="size"><X>1.2</X><Y>0.1</Y><Z>0.9</Z></Vector3><bool name="Anchored">true</bool><bool name="CanCollide">false</bool><bool name="CanTouch">false</bool><bool name="CanQuery">true</bool><float name="Transparency">0</float><token name="Material">512</token><Color3uint8 name="Color3uint8">13483670</Color3uint8><token name="TopSurface">0</token><token name="BottomSurface">0</token></Properties><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7552"><Properties><string name="Name">MaterialName</string><string name="Value">Wood</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7553"><Properties><string name="Name">Role</string><string name="Value">record</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7554"><Properties><string name="Name">Title</string><string name="Value">A letter never collected</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7555"><Properties><string name="Name">Action</string><string name="Value">Read the teacher's letter</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7556"><Properties><string name="Name">Index</string><string name="Value">school_letter</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7557"><Properties><string name="Name">Text</string><string name="Value">Dear parent: your children continue to describe a room absent from the approved plans. Please do not correct their drawings before our meeting. The envelope is addressed to Dad. It has never been opened.</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="Part" referent="RBX7763"><Properties><string name="Name">SchoolReportBoard</string><CoordinateFrame name="CFrame"><X>103</X><Y>4</Y><Z>96.6</Z><R00>1</R00><R01>0</R01><R02>0</R02><R10>0</R10><R11>1</R11><R12>0</R12><R20>0</R20><R21>0</R21><R22>1</R22></CoordinateFrame><Vector3 name="size"><X>1.3</X><Y>1.2</Y><Z>0.1</Z></Vector3><bool name="Anchored">true</bool><bool name="CanCollide">false</bool><bool name="CanTouch">false</bool><bool name="CanQuery">true</bool><float name="Transparency">0</float><token name="Material">512</token><Color3uint8 name="Color3uint8">13483670</Color3uint8><token name="TopSurface">0</token><token name="BottomSurface">0</token></Properties><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7757"><Properties><string name="Name">MaterialName</string><string name="Value">Wood</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7758"><Properties><string name="Name">Role</string><string name="Value">record</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7759"><Properties><string name="Name">Title</string><string name="Value">The duplicated school report</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7760"><Properties><string name="Name">Action</string><string name="Value">Inspect the school report</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7761"><Properties><string name="Name">Index</string><string name="Value">school_report</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7762"><Properties><string name="Name">Text</string><string name="Value">Both reports praise a drawing of the park. Different first names, identical marks, identical date. The teacher has written: Neither child is copying. Please keep both originals.</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="Part" referent="RBX7830"><Properties><string name="Name">BusQueueEasy</string><CoordinateFrame name="CFrame"><X>378</X><Y>2.8</Y><Z>-8</Z><R00>1</R00><R01>0</R01><R02>0</R02><R10>0</R10><R11>1</R11><R12>0</R12><R20>0</R20><R21>0</R21><R22>1</R22></CoordinateFrame><Vector3 name="size"><X>2</X><Y>0.2</Y><Z>1</Z></Vector3><bool name="Anchored">true</bool><bool name="CanCollide">false</bool><bool name="CanTouch">false</bool><bool name="CanQuery">true</bool><float name="Transparency">0</float><token name="Material">512</token><Color3uint8 name="Color3uint8">13483670</Color3uint8><token name="TopSurface">0</token><token name="BottomSurface">0</token></Properties><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7825"><Properties><string name="Name">MaterialName</string><string name="Value">Wood</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7826"><Properties><string name="Name">Role</string><string name="Value">lobbyQueue</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7827"><Properties><string name="Name">Title</string><string name="Value">Easy departure</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7828"><Properties><string name="Name">Action</string><string name="Value">Join Easy bus</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7829"><Properties><string name="Name">Mode</string><string name="Value">Easy</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="Part" referent="RBX7841"><Properties><string name="Name">BusQueueIntermediate</string><CoordinateFrame name="CFrame"><X>400</X><Y>2.8</Y><Z>-8</Z><R00>1</R00><R01>0</R01><R02>0</R02><R10>0</R10><R11>1</R11><R12>0</R12><R20>0</R20><R21>0</R21><R22>1</R22></CoordinateFrame><Vector3 name="size"><X>2</X><Y>0.2</Y><Z>1</Z></Vector3><bool name="Anchored">true</bool><bool name="CanCollide">false</bool><bool name="CanTouch">false</bool><bool name="CanQuery">true</bool><float name="Transparency">0</float><token name="Material">512</token><Color3uint8 name="Color3uint8">13483670</Color3uint8><token name="TopSurface">0</token><token name="BottomSurface">0</token></Properties><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7836"><Properties><string name="Name">MaterialName</string><string name="Value">Wood</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7837"><Properties><string name="Name">Role</string><string name="Value">lobbyQueue</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7838"><Properties><string name="Name">Title</string><string name="Value">Intermediate departure</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7839"><Properties><string name="Name">Action</string><string name="Value">Join Intermediate bus</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7840"><Properties><string name="Name">Mode</string><string name="Value">Intermediate</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="Part" referent="RBX7852"><Properties><string name="Name">BusQueueHard</string><CoordinateFrame name="CFrame"><X>422</X><Y>2.8</Y><Z>-8</Z><R00>1</R00><R01>0</R01><R02>0</R02><R10>0</R10><R11>1</R11><R12>0</R12><R20>0</R20><R21>0</R21><R22>1</R22></CoordinateFrame><Vector3 name="size"><X>2</X><Y>0.2</Y><Z>1</Z></Vector3><bool name="Anchored">true</bool><bool name="CanCollide">false</bool><bool name="CanTouch">false</bool><bool name="CanQuery">true</bool><float name="Transparency">0</float><token name="Material">512</token><Color3uint8 name="Color3uint8">13483670</Color3uint8><token name="TopSurface">0</token><token name="BottomSurface">0</token></Properties><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7847"><Properties><string name="Name">MaterialName</string><string name="Value">Wood</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7848"><Properties><string name="Name">Role</string><string name="Value">lobbyQueue</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7849"><Properties><string name="Name">Title</string><string name="Value">Hard departure</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7850"><Properties><string name="Name">Action</string><string name="Value">Join Hard bus</string></Properties></Item><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX7851"><Properties><string name="Name">Mode</string><string name="Value">Hard</string></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="Part" referent="RBX7901"><Properties><string name="Name">LobbyPracticeNote</string><CoordinateFrame name="CFrame"><X>389</X><Y>3</Y><Z>14</Z><R00>1</R00><R01>0</R01><R02>0</R02><R10>0</R10><R11>1</R11><R12>0</R12><R20>0</R20><R21>0</R21><R22>1</R22></CoordinateFrame><Vector3 name="size"><X>1.2</X><Y>0.1</Y><Z>1</Z></Vector3><bool name="Anchored">true</bool><bool name="Can